lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/9c9452bb47c8a8efc69890d84e2b32f5.poster.avif?t=1766058216\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/9c9452bb47c8a8efc69890d84e2b32f5.webm?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/9c9452bb47c8a8efc69890d84e2b32f5.mp4?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.poster.avif?t=1766058216\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.webm?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/0d8c07edefa4c3e9fbe5765443edd306.mp4?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Insert a second coin and play against a friend in a number of co-operative &amp; competitive arcade games with up to 4 players locally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/919ff554128613f153fadaa1da0dd86c.poster.avif?t=1766058216\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/919ff554128613f153fadaa1da0dd86c.webm?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/919ff554128613f153fadaa1da0dd86c.mp4?t=1766058216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\